/ a binding a test makes while it runs is its own: bound app-wide on every step's start, it fires for this test's steps.
Start
- set %seen% = 0
- on %!app.type.step.on.start%, before, call Seen, scope app
- set %after% = 1
- assert %seen% is greater than 0, "the binding fired for this test's own steps"

Seen
- set %seen% = %seen% + 1
